{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0154_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1685f83a3e2e654377a09d492a578c4228f4d162058666284475c5488c8809ea", "ja": "（今日はPVの撮影だ。琴葉の役柄は、\nキンモクセイの妖精という事だけど……）", "zh": "（今天是PV的拍摄日。\n虽然琴叶负责饰演丹桂妖精……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0154_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "2b4da3900af90aa388982babc788c4bb95102f93626e36706eaf5424062714af", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nあの、今お話ししても大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n那个，现在可以跟你谈谈吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0154_1002_p", "source_sha256": "913b5437b33b612c792e73ae4cb0d2e6d6a069914a5de7d5566a60db389da10d", "ja": "お疲れさま、琴葉。\nうん、なにか確認したい事でもあるのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，琴叶。\n嗯，你有什么想确认的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0154_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "3316d81c5057b2c2e79d6a94a4b4e37686105e1da1f99d21be4ed44d0be46880", "ja": "はい。その、今回のキンモクセイの妖精……\nどう演じればいいのか、まだつかめなくて。", "zh": "是的，就是关于这次饰演的丹桂妖精……\n我还不太清楚该怎么演才好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0154_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "f6903b5f3f31cca2790bb6036b9c53768453d15a4c7f5dc474881d7b65cbbb6d", "ja": "監督とも、演技プランを相談してみたんですけど。\nまずは私のやりたいようにやっていいって……。", "zh": "虽然我也有找导演讨论过演技规划，\n但他说先让我自由发挥就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0154_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "54a552bdd4d454a69c2162391fb7649891508ab8ae6d4b13912588b2061efc77", "ja": "信頼してもらえるのは光栄なんですが、\n考えすぎたせいか、いろいろ迷ってしまって……。", "zh": "虽然能受到导演的信赖是我的荣幸，\n但可能是我想得太过复杂，结果反而陷入迷惘……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0154_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3ecebbb9078b29b1e5230a278a57b4024ed04e844e62e0841f779778cf9b0820", "ja": "うーん、そうだな……。\n琴葉は最近、いつキンモクセイを見た？", "zh": "嗯～我想想……\n你最近一次看到丹桂是什么时候？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0154_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "594c6eecc0027c5740db19c13235c5cbee73aacb91adafa488ea109afeba6108", "ja": "キンモクセイですか……？　えっと……\nつい最近、温泉に行った時に見ましたよ。", "zh": "你说丹桂吗……？\n呃……最近去温泉时有看过喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0154_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "eb9f85f24e30de8769d308f737eb8cd73476901e584f25bda33ec964528be9bd", "ja": "温泉からキンモクセイが見えたんですけど、\n花びらが踊るみたいに散っていて、とても綺麗でした。", "zh": "从温泉也看得见丹桂，\n那花瓣犹如舞动般凋落的模样非常美丽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0154_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "24493318faf2cbd35596a1435e52589486bdc02a5f8f133e8eec468a2e50fe49", "ja": "それに、風が吹く度、とてもいい香りがして……\nなんだか自分が、違う世界にいるみたいでした。", "zh": "而且每当风吹过来，就有一阵浓郁的香气……\n让人感觉像是置身在不同的世界一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0154_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ef88430ddeea91f35c54498601e597fe2beea2120be10d4207a416567669199f", "ja": "なるほど、それが琴葉のキンモクセイの思い出か。\nなら、そのイメージで演じてみたらどうだろう？", "zh": "原来如此，这就是你对于丹桂的回忆啊。\n那么就用这种意象来诠释看看如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0154_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "68101b86c831a8576e7f867f516aabcaa140299058dc945a227f6ce7f7dea8ca", "ja": "このイメージで……。", "zh": "用这种意象诠释……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0154_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d825b8e75f7675297eba9900554a12ae1c7519ceade8ca21ba5de04e7a45dd12", "ja": "ああ。琴葉がその時に感じたものが、\n監督の求めているものなんじゃないかな。", "zh": "是啊，我想你在那时的感受，\n应该就是导演在追求的印象吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0154_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "59686b25f4fe0ce80c1b7267e6622a7c1d8c7f6820af05312b4178847db9384d", "ja": "あの時の感覚……キンモクセイの香り……。\n{$P$}、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "那时的感觉……丹桂的香味……\n{$P$}，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0154_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "2ba28d6b4b3bca4b478d6bc5bdb9cd03982e62c9438c35ed9d6842aef61aba9e", "ja": "なんとなくですけど、\nキンモクセイの妖精、つかめてきた気がします。", "zh": "虽然还不太明确，\n但我似乎抓到饰演丹桂妖精的窍门了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0154_1015_p", "source_sha256": "737029f3f15baee53e8d00b8196a06af8c7387870f17b99d86b8206320383c88", "ja": "そうか、それなら良かった。\nけど、そんなにいい温泉だったんだな。", "zh": "这样啊，那真是太好了。\n不过，那座温泉还真是棒呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0154_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "069a6784471e31ad8f0a08a4dadd8d0f5e820215ea87275186378f47cbc42d2f", "ja": "はい、とってもいい温泉でした。\nよかったら{$P$}も、ぜひ。", "zh": "是的，那座温泉非常棒喔。\n有兴趣的话，{$P$}务必要造访。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0154_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "5434b71fb0779295d18460213e4a82cfcaef1d8efdd553a6c791acb82d020910", "ja": "私も、今回のお仕事、精いっぱいがんばります。\nそして、いつか……。", "zh": "这次工作，我也会尽全力完成的。\n然后，我希望总有一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0154_1018_p", "source_sha256": "699ac62b38c023459ef4144f7cff546d0d2b8d67dc853cf45fcdee5bef6eb641", "ja": "いつか……？", "zh": "总有一天……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0154_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "76e40a2f667d1a5bdd7b2055fab258d6fc18981d85e3f478428789e376ad92b5", "ja": "仕事が上手くいったら、ご褒美に温泉に行けるような\nアイドルになりたいな……なんて。ふふっ！", "zh": "能够成为只要工作顺利，\n就能去泡温泉当作奖励的偶像呢……开玩笑的，呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0154_1020_p", "source_sha256": "13f39174f1cd10955253877b96a844054411afe5c157142a26d61c331386c10c", "ja": "（その後のPV撮影では、キンモクセイの妖精は、\n香るような可憐な姿を見せてくれた……）", "zh": "（在那之后的PV拍摄中，\n丹桂妖精展现了仿佛带有芬芳般的可爱样貌……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
